      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我被雪之美人的声音吓一跳，于是急忙赶过去，\n结果在走廊上看到了──小栗帽。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66b8da189837e815621a062c851dcc42ff76cbadeed0b14622387bbc683d3894",
